# xl 源文件必须是 UTF-8 无 BOM + LF（否则报 E0005），
# 而 ts 产物要跟 C# 生成的基准逐字节比对，所以把检出也钉成 LF：
# 否则在 Windows 上克隆（core.autocrlf=true）会把每个 *.xl.md 变成 CRLF，
# 每个检查都会失败。
* text=auto eol=lf
# cover6: case fixtures may embed a lone CR (U+000D) as an inline line terminator
# inside one physical case line. Git's text=auto already treats such files as binary,
# but pin -text explicitly so the bytes survive commit/checkout on every platform.
typescript/cases/basic-token.ts -text
typescript/cases/cover6-*.ts -text
typescript/cases/*-cr*.ts -text
tests/cases/token/lexical/*-cr*.ts -text
# cover9: end-compute.ts carries inline literal line terminators (CR / U+2028 / U+2029,
# see docs/Final.md §4.1 / §5); pin -text so the CR bytes survive commit/checkout.
typescript/cases/end-compute.ts -text
# cover9: possible-build.ts 的 cover9 段内嵌 lone CR（U+000D）作行内行终止符用例；
# 文件名不含 -cr，故显式钉住字节，避免 CRLF 归一化把它吃掉。
typescript/cases/possible-build.ts -text
# cover9 W2: possible-compute.ts carries an inline lone CR (Z02) as a line terminator
# inside one physical case line; pin -text so the CR bytes survive commit/checkout.
typescript/cases/possible-compute.ts -text
